  </p>

  <h2>3. Consent and Advertising Choices</h2>
  <p>Where required, the Game may provide consent options for
  advertising and related data processing. Available choices may
  depend on your location, device, and applicable requirements.
  You may also be able to manage advertising settings through your
  device settings.</p>

  <h2>4. How Information Is Used</h2>
  <p>Information processed by the Game or its third-party services
  may be used to provide and support the Game, display and measure
  advertisements, prevent abuse or fraud, and diagnose technical
  problems, according to the services and settings in use.</p>

  <h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
  <p>Information may be processed by service providers, including
  Google AdMob, for the purposes described in this policy.
  Their handling of information is governed by their own policies
  and the applicable configuration and consent choices.</p>

  <h2>6. Data Retention and Security</h2>
  <p>Retention and security practices depend on the information
  involved and the services processing it. We encourage users to
  review the privacy information of the third-party services used
  by the Game.</p>

  <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>The Game's intended audience and advertising configuration
